Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:39.82,2:17:40.88,65c922fe04d66e004505c4ac,Umputun,0,0,0,,Где все это?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:40.92,2:17:41.72,65c922fe04d66e004505c4ad,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Дай я уточню.
